lok.com/f/234930/173x60/baaf394a5a/wordsmith.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="173" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-full h-12 object-contain max-xl:h-10" style="color:transparent" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/173x60/34144cc093/passionfroot-3.svg"/></div></div></div></div></div><section class=""><div class="container"><div class="border-subtle-stroke grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 pt-16 lg:pt-24 xl:pt-32 pb-10 lg:pb-16 xl:pb-24"><div class="col-span-12 xl:col-start-2 xl:col-end-12"><div class="flex flex-col pb-10 lg:pb-16 xl:pb-24"><div class="flex flex-col mx-auto max-w-xl items-center text-center"><div class="grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-6 gap-y-4"><div class="col-span-full"><div><h2 class="text-pretty text-heading-responsive-md"><span style="color:#000000">How it works.</span></h2></div></div><p class="col-span-full text-pretty text-lg lg:text-xl">Participate in our referral promo in a few simple steps.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="370" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/370x80/583a6dd887/cursor-7.svg"/><div class="mt-10 text-secondary-foreground"><div class="mr-5"><div class="font-semibold text-lg">1. Share your unique link</div><div class="mt-2.5">Your referrals get 10% off their first year of Attio Pro or Enterprise when they sign up with your referral link.</div></div></div></div></div><div><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="370" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/370x80/32df67e29b/blocks-6.svg"/><div class="mt-10 text-secondary-foreground"><div class="mr-5"><div class="font-semibold text-lg">2. Your referral uses Attio</div><div class="mt-2.5">Your referral converts to Attio Pro or Enterprise within 60 days of signing up, and stays on the plan for 3 consecutive months.</div></div></div></div></div><div><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="370" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/234930/370x80/33abb4f213/diamond-6.svg"/><div class="mt-10 text-secondary-foreground"><div class="mr-5"><div class="font-semibold text-lg">3. Receive your reward</div><div class="mt-2.5">Once your referral has been on Pro or Enterprise for 3 months, we&#x27;ll send you a $200 digital gift card via our reward provider.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=""><div class="container"><div class="border-subtle-stroke grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 pt-10 lg:pt-16 xl:pt-24 pb-16 lg:pb-24 xl:pb-32"><div class="col-span-12 xl:col-start-2 xl:col-end-12"><div class="space-y-4 lg:space-y-6 mx-auto max-w-2xl"><h2 id="faq" class="pr-6 text-heading-responsive-md text-secondary-foreground">Frequently asked questions.</h2><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="relative border-weak-stroke border-b py-7 text-base" id="what-is-the-referral-promo"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_15m6lubsnpfiulkfb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_5m6lubsnpfiulkfb_" class="group -mx-2 -my-1.5 flex w-[calc(100%+12px)] cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-x-6 rounded-xl px-2 py-1.5 text-left outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-3 faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">What is the referral promo?</span><svg width="19.200000000000003" height="12" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="mt-1.25 shrink-0 text-white-900 transition-colors duration-400 ease-in-out group-hover:text-black-800 group-hover:duration-150 group-active:text-black-800 group-active:duration-50 group-data-open:text-bl